From: Jason McCartney <jmacAJ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 13:43:51 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 06/37] perf(glm): promote mixed C4 parity profile

Use the work-conserving 7168-token mixed scheduler envelope with draft TP2 and right-sized indexer workspace. Preserve the q8/p2048 exclusive phase scheduler as an opt-in decode-protection mode.

Co-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
